facilities {
  name: "Eva James Memorial Community Centre"
  description:
    "Eva James Memorial Centre is a bright, modern building offering a variety of recreation programs for all ages. "
    "Programs include fitness, sports, dance, preschool play, and arts. This facility is an ideal rental opportunity "
    "for your meeting or gathering."
