facilities {
  name: "Hunt Club-Riverside Park Community Centre"
  description:
    "Located in the centre of the community, we offer a wide selection of recreation activities. There are programs "
    "for all ages from preschoolers to seniors with arts and crafts, dance classes, language lessons and fitness "
    "programs just to name a few. The Centre features a full gymnasium, weight room, four multipurpose rooms, a "
    "kitchen and onsite parking. It also hosts an Ottawa Public Library kiosk, South-East Ottawa Community Health "
    "Centre and a community exhibition space currently programmed by the Manotick Art Association. Outdoor space "
    "includes play structures, a basketball court, baseball diamond, two soccer fields and a rink."
  source {
    url: "https://ottawa.ca/en/recreation-and-parks/facilities/place-listing/hunt-club-riverside-park-community-centre"
