facilities {
  name: "Minto Recreation Complex - Barrhaven"
  description:
    "The Minto Recreation Complex - Barrhaven was recently listed by Chatelaine Magazine as one of the top 10 best "
    "indoor pools in Canada! Read the Best Indoor Pools in Canada article. The Minto Recreation Complex - Barrhaven "
    "includes a six lane, 25 metre lap pool with three metre and one metre diving boards, and an access ramp (Pool "
    "Rentals, please contact mrcb@ottawa.ca). Two NHL sized ice rinks (one rink is accessible), with accessible change "
    "rooms (please email Centralized Allocations or complete the Centralized Allocations booking form for ice "
    "rentals). Outside find an artificial turf sports field designed to meet CFL and FIFA design standards (please "
    "email Centralized Allocations or complete the Centralized Allocations booking form for field rentals). Artwork "
    "suspended from the ceiling named Mr. Kurokawa. Minto, an active sponsor of community initiatives, is proud to be "
    "associated with the City of Ottawa's Community Champions Program."
  source {
    url: "https://ottawa.ca/en/recreation-and-parks/facilities/place-listing/minto-recreation-complex-barrhaven"
    _date {
      seconds: 1778631816
    }
  }
  address:
    "3500 Cambrian Road\n"
    "Ottawa ON K2J 0V1\n"
    "Canada"
  _lnglat {
    lng: -75.73427
    lat: 45.25277
  }
